{%- comment -%}
  Learn — page d'accueil de l'espace editorial.

  Sert de point d'entree unique pour le SEO : c'est la page qui recoit les
  liens internes depuis le header et le footer, et qui redistribue vers les
  quatre sous-sections. Les derniers articles sont tires du blog s'il en
  contient ; sinon un etat vide ramene vers la gamme plutot que d'afficher une
  grille creuse.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  assign is_fr = false
  if request.locale.iso_code contains 'fr'
    assign is_fr = true
  endif

  assign locale_root = routes.root_url
  if locale_root == '/'
    assign locale_root = ''
  endif

  assign science_url = pages['science'].url
  if science_url == blank
    assign science_url = locale_root | append: '/pages/science'
  endif

  assign how_url = pages['comment-ca-marche'].url
  if how_url == blank
    assign how_url = locale_root | append: '/pages/comment-ca-marche'
  endif

  assign values_url = pages['nos-valeurs'].url
  if values_url == blank
    assign values_url = locale_root | append: '/pages/nos-valeurs'
  endif

  assign wl_url = pages['wavelengths'].url
  if wl_url == blank
    assign wl_url = locale_root | append: '/pages/wavelengths'
  endif

  assign howto_url = pages['how-to-use'].url
  if howto_url == blank
    assign howto_url = locale_root | append: '/pages/how-to-use'
  endif

  assign faq_url = pages['faq'].url
  if faq_url == blank
    assign faq_url = locale_root | append: '/pages/faq'
  endif

  assign learn_blog = blogs['journal']
  if learn_blog.url == blank
    assign learn_blog = blogs['news']
  endif
  assign blog_url = learn_blog.url
  if blog_url == blank
    assign blog_url = locale_root | append: '/blogs/news'
  endif
-%}

<section class="ln-hero">
  <div class="ln-shell">
    <p class="ln-crumbs">
      <a href="{{ routes.root_url }}">{% if is_fr %}Accueil{% else %}Home{% endif %}</a>
      <span aria-hidden="true">/</span>
      {% if is_fr %}Apprendre{% else %}Learn{% endif %}
    </p>
    <p class="ln-kicker">{% if is_fr %}Apprendre{% else %}Learn{% endif %}</p>
    <h1 class="ln-title">
      {%- if is_fr -%}
        Comprendre avant d'acheter. M&ecirc;me si &ccedil;a nous co&ucirc;te une vente.
      {%- else -%}
        Understand before you buy. Even if it costs us the sale.
      {%- endif -%}
    </h1>
    <p class="ln-copy">
      {%- if is_fr -%}
        Sept espaces&nbsp;: la recherche avec ses sources, le fonctionnement r&eacute;el des longueurs
        d'onde, nos r&egrave;gles de s&eacute;lection, et un journal o&ugrave; nous publions nos lectures.
        Aucun ne contient de promesse que nous ne puissions pas documenter.
      {%- else -%}
        Seven spaces: the research with its sources, how wavelengths actually behave, our selection rules,
        and a journal where we publish what we read. None of them contains a promise we cannot document.
      {%- endif -%}
    </p>

    <div class="ln-actions">
      <a class="ln-button ln-button--light" href="{{ science_url }}">
        {% if is_fr %}Commencer par la science{% else %}Start with the science{% endif %}
      </a>
      <a class="ln-button ln-button--line" href="{{ routes.all_products_collection_url }}">
        {% if is_fr %}Voir la gamme{% else %}See the range{% endif %}
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="ln-section">
  <div class="ln-shell">
    <div class="ln-head ln-reveal">
      <div>
        <p class="ln-kicker">{% if is_fr %}Sept entr&eacute;es{% else %}Seven ways in{% endif %}</p>
        <h2 class="ln-title ln-title--wide">
          {%- if is_fr -%}Par o&ugrave; vous voulez commencer&nbsp;?{%- else -%}Where would you like to start?{%- endif -%}
        </h2>
      </div>
      <div class="ln-head__aside">
        <p>
          {%- if is_fr -%}
            Si vous ne savez pas, prenez la science : le reste s'y rattache, et c'est la page qui explique
            pourquoi nous refusons certaines formulations que vous verrez ailleurs.
          {%- else -%}
            If you are not sure, take the science: everything else hangs off it, and it is the page that
            explains why we refuse wording you will see elsewhere.
          {%- endif -%}
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="ln-hub">
      <a class="ln-hub__card ln-reveal" href="{{ science_url }}">
        <span class="ln-hub__num">01</span>
        <h3 class="ln-hub__title">Science</h3>
        <p class="ln-hub__text">
          {%- if is_fr -%}
            Du prix Nobel de 1903 &agrave; l'essai randomis&eacute; de 2024 : quinze jalons, chacun li&eacute;
            &agrave; sa publication d'origine. Avec un bloc entier sur ce que ces travaux ne prouvent pas.
          {%- else -%}
            From the 1903 Nobel Prize to a 2024 randomised trial: fifteen milestones, each linked to its
            original paper. With a whole block on what this work does not prove.
          {%- endif -%}
        </p>
        <span class="ln-link">{% if is_fr %}Voir la frise{% else %}See the timeline{% endif %} <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></span>
      </a>

      <a class="ln-hub__card ln-reveal" href="{{ blog_url }}">
        <span class="ln-hub__num">02</span>
        <h3 class="ln-hub__title">Blog</h3>
        <p class="ln-hub__text">
          {%- if is_fr -%}
            Nos lectures d'&eacute;tudes r&eacute;centes, nos protocoles de test, et les questions que nous
            recevons le plus souvent. Publi&eacute; au fil de l'eau, sans calendrier &eacute;ditorial forc&eacute;.
          {%- else -%}
            Our readings of recent studies, our testing protocols, and the questions we get asked most.
            Published as we go, with no forced editorial calendar.
          {%- endif -%}
        </p>
        <span class="ln-link">{% if is_fr %}Lire les articles{% else %}Read the articles{% endif %} <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></span>
      </a>

      <a class="ln-hub__card ln-reveal" href="{{ how_url }}">
        <span class="ln-hub__num">03</span>
        <h3 class="ln-hub__title">{% if is_fr %}Comment &ccedil;a marche{% else %}How it works{% endif %}</h3>
        <p class="ln-hub__text">
          {%- if is_fr -%}
            Le photon, la cytochrome c oxydase, l'ATP. Les sept longueurs d'onde et leur r&ocirc;le
            respectif. La dose, la distance, et pourquoi doubler la s&eacute;ance ne double pas l'effet.
          {%- else -%}
            The photon, cytochrome c oxidase, ATP. The seven wavelengths and what each one does. Dose,
            distance, and why doubling the session does not double the effect.
          {%- endif -%}
        </p>
        <span class="ln-link">{% if is_fr %}Comprendre{% else %}Understand it{% endif %} <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></span>
      </a>

      <a class="ln-hub__card ln-reveal" href="{{ values_url }}">
        <span class="ln-hub__num">04</span>
        <h3 class="ln-hub__title">{% if is_fr %}Nos valeurs{% else %}Our values{% endif %}</h3>
        <p class="ln-hub__text">
          {%- if is_fr -%}
            Comment un appareil entre dans la gamme, et les six engagements que nous tenons sur ce site
            &mdash; dont trois choses que nous refusons de faire, m&ecirc;me quand elles vendent.
          {%- else -%}
            How a device joins the range, and the six commitments we hold on this site &mdash; including
            three things we refuse to do, even when they sell.
          {%- endif -%}
        </p>
        <span class="ln-link">{% if is_fr %}Lire la m&eacute;thode{% else %}Read the method{% endif %} <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></span>
      </a>
      <a class="ln-hub__card ln-reveal" href="{{ wl_url }}">
        <span class="ln-hub__num">05</span>
        <h3 class="ln-hub__title">{% if is_fr %}Longueurs d'onde{% else %}Wavelengths{% endif %}</h3>
        <p class="ln-hub__text">{%- if is_fr -%}Les sept spectres de 460 &agrave; 940 nm, leur profondeur relative, et sur quel appareil de la gamme chacun se trouve.{%- else -%}The seven spectra from 460 to 940 nm, their relative depth, and which device in the range carries each one.{%- endif -%}</p>
        <span class="ln-link">{% if is_fr %}Voir le spectre{% else %}See the spectrum{% endif %} <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></span>
      </a>
      <a class="ln-hub__card ln-reveal" href="{{ howto_url }}">
        <span class="ln-hub__num">06</span>
        <h3 class="ln-hub__title">{% if is_fr %}Mode d'emploi{% else %}How to use{% endif %}</h3>
        <p class="ln-hub__text">{%- if is_fr -%}Dur&eacute;e, distance et fr&eacute;quence pour chaque format d'appareil, panneau comme accessoire port&eacute;.{%- else -%}Duration, distance and frequency for each device format, panels and wearables alike.{%- endif -%}</p>
        <span class="ln-link">{% if is_fr %}Lire les consignes{% else %}Read the guidance{% endif %} <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></span>
      </a>
      <a class="ln-hub__card ln-reveal" href="{{ faq_url }}">
        <span class="ln-hub__num">07</span>
        <h3 class="ln-hub__title">{% if is_fr %}FAQ{% else %}FAQ{% endif %}</h3>
        <p class="ln-hub__text">{%- if is_fr -%}Essai de 30 jours, garantie, certifications et les questions qui reviennent le plus souvent au support.{%- else -%}The 30-day trial, warranty, certifications and the questions support gets asked most.{%- endif -%}</p>
        <span class="ln-link">{% if is_fr %}Voir la FAQ{% else %}See the FAQ{% endif %} <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="ln-section ln-section--soft">
  <div class="ln-shell">
    <div class="ln-head ln-reveal">
      <div>
        <p class="ln-kicker">{% if is_fr %}Le journal{% else %}The journal{% endif %}</p>
        <h2 class="ln-title ln-title--wide">
          {%- if is_fr -%}Derniers articles.{%- else -%}Latest articles.{%- endif -%}
        </h2>
      </div>
      <div class="ln-head__aside">
        <a class="ln-link" href="{{ blog_url }}">
          {% if is_fr %}Tous les articles{% else %}All articles{% endif %} <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    {%- if learn_blog.articles_count > 0 -%}
      <div class="ln-articles">
        {%- for article in learn_blog.articles limit: 3 -%}
          <a class="ln-article ln-reveal" href="{{ article.url }}">
            <div class="ln-article__media">
              {%- if article.image != blank -%}
                <img src="{{ article.image | image_url: width: 720 }}"
                     srcset="{{ article.image | image_url: width: 480 }} 480w,
                             {{ article.image | image_url: width: 720 }} 720w,
                             {{ article.image | image_url: width: 1080 }} 1080w"
                     sizes="(min-width: 1000px) 380px, 90vw"
                     alt="{{ article.title | escape }}"
                     width="720" height="{{ 720 | divided_by: article.image.aspect_ratio | round }}"
                     loading="lazy" decoding="async">
              {%- else -%}
                {{ 'lifestyle-2' | placeholder_svg_tag }}
              {%- endif -%}
            </div>
            <p class="ln-article__meta">{{ article.published_at | date: '%d.%m.%Y' }}</p>
            <h3 class="ln-article__title">{{ article.title }}</h3>
            <p class="ln-article__excerpt">{{ article.excerpt_or_content | strip_html | truncatewords: 22 }}</p>
            <span class="ln-link">{% if is_fr %}Lire{% else %}Read{% endif %} <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></span>
          </a>
        {%- endfor -%}
      </div>
    {%- else -%}
      <div class="ln-empty ln-reveal">
        <h3>{% if is_fr %}Le premier article arrive{% else %}The first article is on its way{% endif %}</h3>
        <p>
          {%- if is_fr -%}
            Le journal ouvrira avec nos lectures d'&eacute;tudes et nos protocoles de test. En attendant,
            la page Science contient d&eacute;j&agrave; l'essentiel des sources.
          {%- else -%}
            The journal will open with our study readings and testing protocols. In the meantime, the
            Science page already holds most of the sources.
          {%- endif -%}
        </p>
        <a class="ln-button" href="{{ science_url }}">
          {% if is_fr %}Aller &agrave; la page Science{% else %}Go to the Science page{% endif %}
        </a>
      </div>
    {%- endif -%}
  </div>
</section>

{% render 'learn-product-cta' %}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Learn — Hub",
  "tag": "div",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Page d'entree de l'espace Learn. Les liens vers les sous-pages sont resolus par handle (science, how-it-works, our-values) et vers le blog journal ou news. Creer ces pages dans l'admin Shopify avant la mise en ligne."
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
